# Implementation Plan: Property Registration Officer & Department Head

## Overview

Two new roles are being configured — each receives its own dynamic sidebar, tailored dashboard with live action worklists, and granular permissions injected into the relevant workflow pages.

---

## Role 6 — Property Registration Officer (`Property Registration Officer`)

### Responsibilities
- Generate the official Goods Receiving Note **Model 19 (GRN)** once Store Head recorded the receipt **and** TEC has approved it  
- Register fixed assets with a unique tag, linked to the originating GRN  
- Assign and reassign fixed-asset custodians  
- Create and print per-custodian **User-Cards** and manage periodic physical verification sign-off  

### Sidebar — `PRO_NAV` (label: **Property Records & Asset Registry**)
| Section | Items |
|---|---|
| Overview | PRO Dashboard (`/`) |
| Official Documentation | GRN Generation — Model 19 (`/goods-receipt`), Fixed Asset Register (`/fixed-assets`) |
| Custodian Management | User-Cards & Custody Assignments (`/fixed-assets`), Assign / Reassign Custodians (`/fixed-assets`) |
| Supporting Records | Item Master Catalog (`/items`), Goods Receipts Log (`/goods-receipt`), Suppliers & GRN Sources (`/suppliers`) |
| Audit & Compliance | Fixed Asset Audit Trail (`/audit-log`) |

> Navigation re-uses existing routes; the dashboard and FixedAssets page content is differentiated by role.

### PRO Dashboard
- **Stat cards**: GRNs generated today, Fixed assets registered (total), Pending GRN generation (receipts TEC-Approved but not yet GRN'd), User-cards count
- **Live Worklist A — "TEC-Approved Receipts Awaiting GRN Generation"**: Lists all `goodsReceipts` where `status === "Approved"` (TEC done, no GRN yet). Each row has a **"Generate GRN (Model 19)"** 1-click button calling `generateGrn()`.
- **Live Worklist B — "Fixed Assets Pending Custodian Assignment"**: Fixed assets without a custodian or with status `"Unassigned"`.
- **Quick Actions**: Register New Asset, View User-Cards, Audit Trail.

### Permission Changes in Workflow Pages

#### `GoodsReceipt.jsx`
```diff
