```
> Already correct — PRO can call `generateGrn()`. No change needed.

#### `FixedAssets.jsx`
- `canRegister` already includes `"Property Registration Officer"` ✓
- **ADD**: `canAssignCustodian` flag so PRO can reassign custodians inline (new "Reassign" column in the DataTable).

